                     JoyComment V1.2 coded by AtomiX/OTL


WHAT'S THE USE OF THIS TOOL ?
-----------------------------

        This is a nice Comment-Door (hard to guess, eyh) !

        You can specify Sysops and Comments via tooltypes,
        you also can specify what access-level the cosysops
        will be shown (so new users only see main-sysop) !


        OrginalFileLength:  JoyComment/JoyComment.xim=16212 bytes

HISTORY :
---------

        V1.0 -   First Release
        V1.1 -   Optimized and writen a new Turbo Routine for faster
                 Screen Output
        V1.2 -   Turbo Routine rewritten ... Internal changes


HOW TO INSTALL :
----------------

        This is a XIM Door !

        Copy just all to the BBS i prepared it so that it is working
        automatically ;^)) !


        Configure the "DOORS:JOYCOMENNT/JoyComment.xim.info"

        ToolTypes:
        ---------

        SYSOPS=               <Add the MAX Number of Sysops you want>
        SYSOP.x=              <Here the Name of the Sys/CoSysop>
        COMMENT.x=            <  "   " Comment of the " ">
        MENU_LEVEL=           <  "   " Access Level which is allowed
                                to view the Sysop Menu (Default is 20)>

        So that's all i you have a Problem with my Door/s then leave me
        a mail or call me.

        iF YoU FoUnD BuGS or have Suggestion's let me know on AmiXnet

